"""
Picnic Grocery Delivery Source (Example/Template).
This is a template for integrating Picnic as a data source.

To activate:
1. Rename this file to picnic.py
2. Configure Picnic credentials in .env
3. The source will auto-register when the app starts

Note: You already have access to Picnic via MCP tools:
- mcp_picnic_picnic_get_deliveries: Get order history
- mcp_picnic_picnic_get_delivery: Get order details
